# Patches applied to pinned external dependencies from MODULE.bazel's
# single_version_override. bzlmod reads these by path during module
# resolution, so a patch works even when it isn't exported here -- which is
# exactly why this is a glob rather than a list: a missing entry would not
# break the build, it would only make `bazel query` disagree with reality
# about a file that is very much part of it.
exports_files(glob(["*.patch"]))
